{
  "source": "course-assets/what-is-ai/what-is-ai.mp4",
  "duration": 160.2133125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.92,
      "text": "You need to start your next history project, but you haven't picked a topic."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.62,
      "end": 7.76,
      "text": "You look around the room for inspiration. Ask your desk,"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.48,
      "end": 11.98,
      "text": "give me 10 ideas for my next history project. Nothing."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.46,
      "end": 16.12,
      "text": "It's a desk. Ask a friend, and they can help you"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.12,
      "end": 20.0,
      "text": "brainstorm. Ask AI, and it can give you a list in"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.0,
      "end": 24.06,
      "text": "seconds. AI is software built to do things that used to take"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.06,
      "end": 27.8,
      "text": "a human brain. It can understand a question, summarize"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.8,
      "end": 32.06,
      "text": "a long document or translate a conversation. That doesn't mean it"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.06,
      "end": 36.16,
      "text": "actually thinks like your friend or that all 10 of those history ideas will"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.16,
      "end": 40.86,
      "text": "be good. You simply have a tool that can help with cognitive tasks that once"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.86,
      "end": 45.62,
      "text": "required a person. Different AI systems do different jobs. Let's look"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.62,
      "end": 49.76,
      "text": "at two kinds you already use. This graphic breaks down these tools into"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.76,
      "end": 55.3,
      "text": "two main categories. First is recommendation AI. Its job is to choose"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.3,
      "end": 56.56,
      "text": "from what already exists."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.16,
      "end": 59.34,
      "text": "It works by ranking the available options"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.34,
      "end": 61.9,
      "text": "and selecting the likely best match for you."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.56,
      "end": 63.48,
      "text": "You see this every day"
    },
    {
      "start": 63.48,
      "end": 65.28,
      "text": "when you get a suggested Netflix show,"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.78,
      "end": 67.68,
      "text": "a Spotify song, or a maps route."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.5,
      "end": 70.04,
      "text": "Then there is generative AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.76,
      "end": 72.82,
      "text": "Its job is to make something that didn't exist."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.5,
      "end": 75.4,
      "text": "The engine behind this creation process"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.4,
      "end": 77.02,
      "text": "is something called a prompt."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.32,
      "end": 79.3,
      "text": "That's simply the specific question"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.3,
      "end": 81.54,
      "text": "or set of instructions you type into the system."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.22,
      "end": 84.12,
      "text": "This can result in a brand new email,"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.12,
      "end": 88.8,
      "text": "an essay, an image, a website, a song, or a video."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.44,
      "end": 91.94,
      "text": "AI left the realm of science fiction years ago"
    },
    {
      "start": 91.94,
      "end": 93.64,
      "text": "to become part of your daily routine."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.3,
      "end": 95.76,
      "text": "It operates the apps on your phone"
    },
    {
      "start": 95.76,
      "end": 97.78,
      "text": "and powers the tools your first job"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.78,
      "end": 98.96,
      "text": "will hand you on day one."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.62,
      "end": 102.48,
      "text": "Most of what it does today, it will do better tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "start": 103.92,
      "end": 105.38,
      "text": "This graphic shows a breakdown"
    },
    {
      "start": 105.38,
      "end": 108.64,
      "text": "of exactly where AI already lives in your daily routine."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.26,
      "end": 110.88,
      "text": "First, it recommends media"
    },
    {
      "start": 110.88,
      "end": 112.76,
      "text": "by predicting what you might like next."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.76,
      "end": 116.06,
      "text": "You interact with this on Spotify, Netflix, and TikTok."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.34,
      "end": 119.54,
      "text": "Second, navigation tools predict traffic"
    },
    {
      "start": 119.54,
      "end": 122.52,
      "text": "and your arrival time on apps like Google Maps and Waze."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.48,
      "end": 126.08,
      "text": "Third, face recognition validates your identity,"
    },
    {
      "start": 126.38,
      "end": 127.88,
      "text": "checking whether a face matches you"
    },
    {
      "start": 127.88,
      "end": 129.56,
      "text": "for phone unlocks and photo tagging."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.46,
      "end": 133.38,
      "text": "Fourth, voice assistants turn your speech into words"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.38,
      "end": 135.88,
      "text": "when you talk to Siri, Alexa, or Hey Google."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.64000000000001,
      "end": 140.12,
      "text": "Finally, chatbots carry on direct conversations with you"
    },
    {
      "start": 140.12,
      "end": 143.2,
      "text": "through programs like ChatGPT, Claude, and Gemini."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.32,
      "end": 146.98,
      "text": "Looking at this complete picture shows us something clear."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.6,
      "end": 150.66,
      "text": "AI was already part of your day before chatbots arrived."
    },
    {
      "start": 152.1,
      "end": 153.82,
      "text": "You've got a tool that can help."
    },
    {
      "start": 154.54,
      "end": 155.56,
      "text": "What could it help you do?"
    }
  ],
